                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0e2cdfdb-4b01-3c1c-878a-85fb21dfad4c",
                        "entry_id": "0a0e84c5-8329-390c-be8a-f76099e7c510",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to hurry, to hasten, to make haste, to be in a hurry"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "85b11efd-68a3-4f5d-9501-e5fadeb4fbde",
                                "sense_id": "0e2cdfdb-4b01-3c1c-878a-85fb21dfad4c",
                                "text": "Дово́льный произвёденным впечатле́нием, он поспеши́л отыска́ть ша́пку и отпра́вился игра́ть на биллиа́рде.",
                                "translation": "Gratified by the impression he had produced, he made haste to find his cap and went out to play billiards.",
                                "english": "Gratified by the impression he had produced, he made haste to find his cap and went out to play billiards."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "016f32b7-0815-412b-92a1-9751d4a63502",
                                "sense_id": "0e2cdfdb-4b01-3c1c-878a-85fb21dfad4c",
                                "text": "След отше́дшей души́\nВыпада́ет дождём.\nМы тебя́ подождём.\nПоспеши́."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
